==Strategy==
Much like [[Revenge of N-1 (Merciless)|Revenge of N-1]], the restriction doesn't cut many of the useful units for this stage, such as [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can]], [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime]], [[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Stone]], [[Cutter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cutter]], [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train]] and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier]]. With the enemy magnification and nasty Cat limit unchanged, most strategies that work for [[Dogsville (Merciless)|Dogsville]] without Ubers/Legends work here as well, which is fitting since this stage is only unlocked after beating Dogsville. As such, this is essentially a version of Dogsville that forces the player to play Uberless.

