==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]], Dogsville Annex was an Insane stage. This was most likely a translation error.
*Dogsville Annex and [[Black Hole (Cats of the Cosmos)|Black Hole]] are the only [[Restriction Stage]]s to have two different restrictions.
**Incidentally, both stages limit the possible Cat rarities and have a Cat limit of 10.

